daemonset 
## Like the deployment, DaemonSet also ensures that a copy of a pod is running on all (or some) nodes in the cluster.
## However, unlike Deployment which manages replicas of pods through ReplicaSets, DaemonSet ensures that a pod runs on every node (or a specified subset of nodes) in the cluster.
## This is particularly useful for running background tasks or services that need to be present on all nodes, such as log collection agents, monitoring agents, or network proxies.
apiVersion: apps/v1
